---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BreadcrumbNav from '../components/BreadcrumbNav.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — PerfectRingSizer"
  description="Read PerfectRingSizer's privacy policy. Learn how we handle your data and protect your privacy."
>
  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <BreadcrumbNav items={[{ label: 'Privacy Policy', href: '/privacy-policy' }]} />

      <h1 class="mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-text-muted mb-8">Last updated: April 2026</p>

      <div class="prose max-w-none space-y-8 text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
        <div>
          <p>
            At PerfectRingSizer, your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and your rights regarding your data. By using our website, you agree to the practices described below.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-3 text-primary">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            PerfectRingSizer does not require you to create an account or provide personal information to use our tools. We do not collect names, email addresses, or payment information.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            The only data we collect is <strong>anonymous usage analytics</strong> through Google Analytics, which may include:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mt-3">
            <li>Pages visited and time spent on pages</li>
            <li>Referring website or source</li>
            <li>Browser type and device information</li>
            <li>Approximate geographic location (country/region level)</li>
            <li>Interactions with tools and features</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">This data is aggregated and anonymized. It cannot be used to identify individual users.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-3 text-primary">2. Cookies</h2>
          <p>Our website uses the following types of cookies:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mt-3">
            <li><strong>Analytics cookies</strong> — Set by Google Analytics to help us understand how visitors use our site. These cookies collect anonymous information about your browsing behavior.</li>
            <li><strong>Preference cookies</strong> — Used to remember your settings, such as screen calibration data for our ring sizing tool. These are stored locally on your device.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">You can disable cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect the functionality of certain tools.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-3 text-primary">3. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>We use the following third-party services:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mt-3">
            <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> — For anonymous website usage analytics. Google's privacy policy can be found at <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-light underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>Affiliate partners</strong> — When you click on affiliate links, you may be directed to third-party retailer websites. These sites have their own privacy policies, and we encourage you to review them. We do not share any personal data with affiliate partners.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-3 text-primary">4. No Personal Data Collection</h2>
          <p>
            PerfectRingSizer is designed to work without collecting personal data. We do not require accounts, do not collect email addresses, and do not store any ring measurements on our servers. All measurement data from our tools is processed locally in your browser and is never transmitted to us.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-3 text-primary">5. Data Retention</h2>
          <p>
            Google Analytics data is retained for 14 months before being automatically deleted. Preference cookies stored on your device persist until you clear your browser data or they expire naturally.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-3 text-primary">6. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>You have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 mt-3">
            <li>Opt out of Google Analytics tracking by using the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-light underline underline-offset-2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</li>
            <li>Disable cookies through your browser settings.</li>
            <li>Request information about any data we may hold (though we collect no personally identifiable information).</li>
            <li>Contact us with any privacy-related concerns.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-3 text-primary">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-3 text-primary">8. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>
            If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please reach out to us through our <a href="/contact" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-light underline underline-offset-2">Contact page</a> or email us at <a href="mailto:contact@perfectringsizer.com" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-light underline underline-offset-2">contact@perfectringsizer.com</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
